# The Polaris landing page. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) for a local
# build; on Vercel set these in the project's Environment Variables. Both are
# public (NEXT_PUBLIC_*, inlined into the page when it is built), and both
# are optional: unset, the buttons stay on this page as in-page anchors.

# The Polaris app (apps/app): "Get the app".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.example.com

# Polaris for Business (apps/business): "Log in" (/login) and "Start accepting".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BUSINESS_URL=https://business.example.com
